{"candidateAnswer":"Building a loyal customer base through great experiences","evidence":"[D3:8 | 12:48 am on 1 February, 2023] Gina: Thanks! Making my spot comfortable and inviting for my customers is key. I want 'em to feel like they're in a cool oasis. Just creating an experience that'll make 'em wanna come back.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9c91f05d-7986-5cda-afb0-6ed5c7782679","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:45314251d3342b08887f3bbfdfe49baa0b7ff4a38b18719bb8f0bb263018ac6e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Gina say about creating an experience for her customers?","referenceAnswer":"making them want to come back","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"45314251d3342b08887f3bbfdfe49baa0b7ff4a38b18719bb8f0bb263018ac6e"}}]}